DASH.glossary.hl={m:"Breadth",d:"New highs = NYSE stocks at a 52-week high; new lows = at a 52-week low. Index up while lows outnumber highs = a narrow bounce. Latest session (Mon 2 Nov): 82 highs vs 96 lows (WSJ). Highs slipped from 92 but lows fell more from 169, so the selling eased outside tech even as the S&P fell 0.5%. Watch whether lows stay below 100 this week."};
